# Work in progress — on this Mac only.
#
# Two separate hazards, and this covers the second one:
#   deploying  — Cloudflare uploads public/ read from disk, not from git, and
#                scripts/dispatch/run.py ends in `wrangler deploy`. Anything
#                unfinished in public/ goes live on the next Dispatch edition.
#                That is why preview/ sits outside public/.
#   publishing — this repo is public on GitHub, so a commit is a publication
#                of its own. Unfinished design does not belong there either.
preview/
